# Baliza Daily Extraction and Upload
# Runs daily at 03:00 UTC (after CausaGanha at 02:00 UTC)
#
# Installation:
#   crontab -e
#   # Paste the line below (adjust paths as needed):
#   0 3 * * * cd /opt/baliza && /opt/baliza/scripts/daily_pipeline.py >> /var/log/baliza/daily.log 2>&1

# The actual cron job line (uncommented when installed):
# 0 3 * * * cd /opt/baliza && source /etc/baliza/environment && /opt/baliza/scripts/daily_pipeline.py >> /var/log/baliza/daily.log 2>&1
